From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:35:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1016/3799] soh: rename func_809B4800 -> EnArrow_UpdateBlure

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: transforms the fixed tip and base offsets by the current matrix and feeds them to EffectBlure_AddVertex, extending the arrow's trail; called from the draw function.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Arrow/z_en_arrow.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Arrow/z_en_arrow.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Arrow/z_en_arrow.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Arrow/z_en_arrow.c
index a5608492d..580195742 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Arrow/z_en_arrow.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Arrow/z_en_arrow.c
@@ -470,7 +470,8 @@ void EnArrow_Update(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_809B4800(EnArrow* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_809B4800: transforms the fixed tip and base offsets by the current matrix and feeds them to EffectBlure_AddVertex, extending the arrow's trail; called from the draw function.
+void EnArrow_UpdateBlure(EnArrow* this, PlayState* play) {
     static Vec3f D_809B4E88 = { 0.0f, 400.0f, 1500.0f };
     static Vec3f D_809B4E94 = { 0.0f, -400.0f, 1500.0f };
     static Vec3f D_809B4EA0 = { 0.0f, 0.0f, -300.0f };
@@ -546,5 +547,5 @@ void EnArrow_Draw(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
         CLOSE_DISPS(play->state.gfxCtx);
     }
 
-    func_809B4800(this, play);
+    EnArrow_UpdateBlure(this, play);  // was func_809B4800 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
